WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.780
This is Green Leaf Kitchen, on a sunny corner in Fort Lauderdale.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:09.240
When Alex Rivera went Vegan, Alex wanted a place to eat that was not just a great Vegan restaurant,

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.160
but a great restaurant, period.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.940
So Alex took years in hospitality and built one from scratch:

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.500
twelve tables, a patio, and a counter that opens at eight.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.880
Vegans Explore and LESARUSS take care of everything behind the scenes:

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.180
the website, the photos, the marketing and the numbers.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.620
And Alex can see all of it, any time, in one place.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.720
That leaves Alex free to focus on the food and the vision.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.860
Today, Green Leaf serves the Vegan community, and all of South Florida,

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.500
with great food, led with compassion.
